// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_uac_bypass_sdclt.yml
// ID Sigma: 40f9af16-589d-4984-b78d-8c2aec023197
// Título: Potential UAC Bypass Via Sdclt.EXE
// Descripción: A General detection for sdclt being spawned as an elevated process. This could be an indicator of sdclt being used for bypass UAC techniques.
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_uac_bypass_sdclt.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "sdclt.exe" and (ProcessIntegrityLevel in~ ("High", "S-1-16-12288"))
